WEBVTT

00:01:54.070 --> 00:01:56.080
It's already autumn.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:01:59.970
Aoi-san, you're so cute!

00:02:08.770 --> 00:02:11.060
Ooya-san{Miss Landlord}, that looks really great on you!

00:02:14.250 --> 00:02:15.850
Y-You think so?

00:02:15.850 --> 00:02:18.280
You all look very pretty, as well.

00:02:19.850 --> 00:02:21.050
You think so?

00:02:23.020 --> 00:02:25.080
But Mayu is the cutest of all!

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:29.080
See? See? See? See?

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:31.480
And why are you here?

00:02:31.480 --> 00:02:34.330
To help Hanabishi-sama out, of course!

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:41.890
Because he and Mayu will use this school festival to create an ennui autumn story by ourselves.

00:02:41.890 --> 00:02:44.950
Over here, Hanabishi-sama!

00:02:46.010 --> 00:02:48.270
Wait for me, Mayu-chan!

00:02:49.850 --> 00:02:50.480
Oh, no...

00:02:50.480 --> 00:02:51.400
Oh, I see.

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:53.810
A-A-Aoi-sama, that outfit...

00:02:53.810 --> 00:02:54.740
U-Um...

00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:55.770
All right!

00:02:55.770 --> 00:02:57.190
Let's go to the next one! Next!

00:02:57.190 --> 00:02:59.390
At the school festival tomorrow,

00:02:59.390 --> 00:03:03.900
the entire photo club will have
what they call a cosplay cafe.

00:03:03.900 --> 00:03:05.450
They are trying the outfits.

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:06.800
Come on, hurry.

00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:07.690
You, too.

00:03:08.170 --> 00:03:09.320
Oh, all right.

00:03:09.320 --> 00:03:10.580
Aoi-sama...

00:03:10.580 --> 00:03:12.750
Huh? Say, where's Kaoru?

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:15.660
Maybe he's not done changing yet?

00:03:15.660 --> 00:03:17.920
Kaoru, how long will it take?

00:03:19.850 --> 00:03:20.580
Idiot!

00:03:29.920 --> 00:03:31.140
Kaoru-sama.

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:44.600
Kaoru-sama!

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:47.170
I'm so surprised.

00:03:47.170 --> 00:03:49.870
To think she would laugh out loud so much!

00:03:52.310 --> 00:03:55.170
I didn't want Aoi-chan to see me like this.

00:03:56.050 --> 00:03:56.920
Kaoru-dono.

00:03:57.310 --> 00:03:58.500
Ah!

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:00.630
You should hold your head up high.

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:03.480
This is not something anyone can do.

00:04:22.210 --> 00:04:24.110
Aoi-chan! Miyabi-san!

00:04:24.110 --> 00:04:25.160
Over here!

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:27.490
Oh, Kaoru-sama!

00:04:32.920 --> 00:04:34.300
Welcome!

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:36.000
Welcome to <i>Animal.</i>

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:41.210
Honestly!

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:43.710
Why do I have to wash the dishes?

00:04:43.710 --> 00:04:51.020
I'm supposed to be writing the first chapter of Mayu's autumn story with Hanabishi-sama right now!

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:53.170
Look, look, President!

00:04:53.170 --> 00:04:55.650
I'm looking, I'm looking, Vice-president!

00:04:56.060 --> 00:04:59.020
To think the cosplay cafe would be so popular...

00:04:59.020 --> 00:05:03.440
The club's always in the red,
but we're sure to hit black now!

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:06.490
Our next camp will definitely be overseas!

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:07.450
Ah?!

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:07.450
Eh?!

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:13.210
Thank you all for waiting!

00:05:13.210 --> 00:05:15.710
It's time for our special service!

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:19.450
It's the skinship time with the customers!

00:05:19.450 --> 00:05:21.120
The skinship time?

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:22.000
That means

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:23.630
that roll

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:23.670
that roll

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:23.710
that roll

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:25.760
and this pitch

00:05:25.970 --> 00:05:28.470
are OK to be played?

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:30.690
Did we have such a service?

00:05:30.690 --> 00:05:31.890
Don't know.

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:35.810
Well then, skinship time with
the customers starts now!

00:05:51.460 --> 00:05:52.930
What's going on?

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:55.130
H-Huh?

00:05:58.880 --> 00:06:00.840
What are you going to do, Tina?

00:06:01.280 --> 00:06:03.040
The place is completely wrecked...

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:05.210
and the chance of the
customers coming back is zero!

00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:11.220
No matter how much you like animals and because this is Animal Cafe, there's no excuse for reptiles.

00:06:12.130 --> 00:06:13.670
Why? Why?

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:15.430
They're all so cute...

00:06:16.060 --> 00:06:18.770
I went outta my way to rent
'em from the pet shop.

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:21.130
Well, she didn't have ill will,

00:06:21.130 --> 00:06:22.940
Her intentions were good-

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:24.100
That's right!

00:06:24.100 --> 00:06:26.070
I knew Kaoru would understand.

00:06:26.730 --> 00:06:27.980
Don't get that thing near me!

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:32.010
But the festival is three days including today.

00:06:32.010 --> 00:06:33.650
What will we do now?

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:41.400
Everyone.

00:06:41.400 --> 00:06:41.880
Hmm!

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:43.620
Do not be so depressed.

00:06:43.620 --> 00:06:45.370
How about some tea?

00:06:49.510 --> 00:06:51.140
Delicious.

00:06:51.790 --> 00:06:52.890
Tasty.

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:56.390
I've never had Japanese tea this good before.

00:06:56.390 --> 00:07:00.350
The tea you make is always really delicious.

00:07:00.350 --> 00:07:01.560
Thank you very much.

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:05.650
Nothing like good tea when you're Japanese.

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:07.860
Who is Japanese? Who?

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:10.240
Yeah, this really was tasty.

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:13.390
But this was cheap, ordinary
tea lying around here.

00:07:13.390 --> 00:07:17.340
Even using the same tea,
I can't get the same taste as her.

00:07:17.340 --> 00:07:18.840
It's strange.

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:20.620
I see!

00:07:20.620 --> 00:07:22.450
This! This is it!

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:23.670
Ooya-san{Miss Landlord}!

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:25.630
E-Eh?!

00:07:37.070 --> 00:07:38.770
All right, it's done.

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:43.730
U-Um...

00:07:44.180 --> 00:07:48.230
It really is embarrassing for it to
have the same name as me.

00:07:48.230 --> 00:07:50.420
What are you talking about?

00:07:50.420 --> 00:07:54.870
This Japanese cafe won't work without you!

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:58.260
You're willing to help, and
you're lending us the outfits.

00:07:58.260 --> 00:08:00.270
We really can't thank you enough.

00:08:00.270 --> 00:08:02.020
Oh, no...

00:08:02.830 --> 00:08:05.380
I am glad to be of aid to you all.

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:07.870
Hey, the outfits are here!

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:11.780
Here, Tae-chin.

00:08:11.780 --> 00:08:13.470
Thank you very much.

00:08:15.070 --> 00:08:16.640
Looking authentic.

00:08:22.120 --> 00:08:23.690
What's wrong, Hanabishi?

00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:25.730
Ah, no, it's nothing.

00:08:26.360 --> 00:08:28.130
Don't be so spaced out.

00:08:28.130 --> 00:08:30.740
We have to get everything done today.

00:08:30.740 --> 00:08:32.300
Yeah, I know.

00:08:42.770 --> 00:08:44.120
Hey, Ooya-san{Miss Landlord}.

00:08:44.120 --> 00:08:46.250
No underwear under this, right?

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:47.220
Is that so?

00:08:47.220 --> 00:08:48.340
Aoi-san.

00:08:48.340 --> 00:08:51.070
Y-You can keep {lingerie}underwear on.

00:08:51.910 --> 00:08:55.300
Extra pads around your chest will be better.

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:58.350
Tae-chin is so lucky to have such big breasts!

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:04.520
There!

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:05.970
Forgive me!

00:09:05.970 --> 00:09:08.890
Aoi-sama, the tea room is now ready.

00:09:08.890 --> 00:09:11.110
It's all right! It's all right!

00:09:11.110 --> 00:09:12.390
Oh, no!

00:09:13.370 --> 00:09:16.030
It looks like it will be a while yet.

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:18.130
I apologize.

00:09:20.270 --> 00:09:24.460
I will now have you all learn
the basics of the tea ceremony.

00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:32.710
It is not all that difficult,
so please do not be so tense.

00:09:40.630 --> 00:09:42.960
My legs... My legs...

00:09:43.430 --> 00:09:44.680
Huh!

00:09:45.080 --> 00:09:47.100
Tina-senpai, take a look.

00:09:47.100 --> 00:09:47.690
Eh!

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:51.280
Don't you think Senpai looks very fitting here?

00:09:51.280 --> 00:09:54.140
How can he sit like this so easily?

00:09:57.860 --> 00:10:00.860
First, I will show you an example.

00:10:16.560 --> 00:10:19.550
Anyway, I'd like you all to do this much.

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:30.620
They will learn before the night is over, right?

00:10:30.620 --> 00:10:31.910
Y-Yes...

00:10:49.300 --> 00:10:53.230
I had sworn I'd never wear Japanese clothing again.

00:10:55.170 --> 00:10:56.930
The scars on my back

00:10:57.970 --> 00:10:59.130
hurt.

00:11:01.670 --> 00:11:02.830
They hurt.

00:11:04.810 --> 00:11:05.970
They hurt.

00:11:07.350 --> 00:11:08.270
Kaoru-sama.

00:11:08.270 --> 00:11:09.440
Ah!

00:11:14.790 --> 00:11:16.210
Aoi-chan.

00:11:16.210 --> 00:11:17.110
What's wrong?

00:11:20.220 --> 00:11:21.250
I am sorry.

00:11:21.250 --> 00:11:21.790
Emm

00:11:21.790 --> 00:11:24.200
I did not realize.

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:27.120
I have reminded you of some bad memories.

00:11:27.490 --> 00:11:28.870
It's all right.

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:30.740
I don't mind at all.

00:11:31.800 --> 00:11:33.180
Now let's go back.

00:11:33.180 --> 00:11:34.880
We'll get cold if we stay out here.

00:11:35.680 --> 00:11:36.670
Kaoru-sama.

00:11:36.670 --> 00:11:37.600
Emm?!

00:11:41.280 --> 00:11:42.440
Kaoru-sama.

00:11:47.850 --> 00:11:54.980
I wish I could take your grief and pain
in your place, if only I could, Kaoru-sama.

00:11:57.360 --> 00:11:58.630
Aoi-chan.

00:11:59.690 --> 00:12:03.420
However, I am your fiancé, Kaoru-sama.

00:12:03.940 --> 00:12:07.460
I can share feelings together with you.

00:12:08.450 --> 00:12:12.680
So please, do not grieve alone.

00:12:13.450 --> 00:12:14.040
Kaoru-sama.

00:12:20.220 --> 00:12:21.210
Okay.

00:12:41.190 --> 00:12:43.480
Tasty!

00:12:43.480 --> 00:12:47.030
I didn't know tea was this delicious!

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:48.830
Can I have another cup?

00:12:48.830 --> 00:12:49.710
Me, too!

00:12:49.710 --> 00:12:50.320
Same here.

00:12:50.680 --> 00:12:52.150
S-Sure!

00:12:52.150 --> 00:12:54.030
Please wait a moment.

00:12:54.030 --> 00:12:56.280
Look, look, President!

00:12:56.280 --> 00:12:58.880
I'm looking, I'm looking, Vice-president!

00:12:59.570 --> 00:13:01.930
My intuition about this was right!

00:13:01.930 --> 00:13:04.580
This time, we're sure to be in the black!

00:13:04.580 --> 00:13:08.500
Now the photo club's first
camp overseas is definite!

00:13:11.140 --> 00:13:14.820
Hey, I hear there's a real cutie at the photo club's cafe.

00:13:14.820 --> 00:13:15.910
For real?

00:13:15.910 --> 00:13:16.900
Let's go!

00:13:19.550 --> 00:13:22.440
Looks like we'll have more
customers than expected.

00:13:24.400 --> 00:13:26.240
Em, ah!

00:13:26.590 --> 00:13:27.680
Onii-chan{Big Brother}!

00:13:28.960 --> 00:13:30.200
Chika-chan!

00:13:30.590 --> 00:13:31.690
Chika-san.

00:13:32.240 --> 00:13:33.620
Why are you here?

00:13:35.090 --> 00:13:37.330
I got this from Tae Nee-chan!

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:38.100
Hey, guys!

00:13:39.080 --> 00:13:41.050
Oh, Chika-rin!

00:13:47.070 --> 00:13:48.760
Thank you very much!

00:13:49.140 --> 00:13:53.590
I apologize for making you work,
though you came here to play.

00:13:53.590 --> 00:13:55.230
Don't worry, I don't mind.

00:13:55.230 --> 00:13:56.900
There's no tea left!

00:13:56.900 --> 00:13:58.230
Can you bring some quick?

00:13:58.230 --> 00:13:59.650
I'm sorry!

00:13:59.650 --> 00:14:01.930
We're out of bowls!

00:14:01.930 --> 00:14:04.730
Where are the extra tea candies?

00:14:05.120 --> 00:14:07.390
Yes, I will be right over!

00:14:12.900 --> 00:14:14.610
Ooya-san{Miss Landlord}, Ooya-san{Miss Landlord}.

00:14:14.610 --> 00:14:16.480
Yes, what is it?

00:14:16.480 --> 00:14:19.450
Ooya-san{Miss Landlord}, we can take
over here, so please rest.

00:14:19.450 --> 00:14:20.660
Eh, but...

00:14:21.140 --> 00:14:24.160
You've been working nonstop since this morning.

00:14:24.160 --> 00:14:26.220
The others are getting the hang of things.

00:14:26.220 --> 00:14:27.850
I see.

00:14:28.410 --> 00:14:30.180
Then I will take your advice.

00:14:38.760 --> 00:14:39.750
Kaoru-sama!

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:42.690
Aoi-chan.

00:14:43.100 --> 00:14:44.340
Good work.

00:14:44.340 --> 00:14:46.180
How is the cafe doing?

00:14:46.180 --> 00:14:49.240
Yes, everyone is doing their best,

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:52.700
and thanks to your advertising,
we're doing very well.

00:14:52.090 --> 00:14:54.080
Delicious takoyaki right here!

00:14:52.700 --> 00:14:54.080
Oh, that's great.

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:54.540
Ah.

00:14:55.210 --> 00:14:56.840
Do you want to eat takoyaki?

00:14:56.840 --> 00:14:58.160
It's almost lunchtime.

00:14:58.580 --> 00:14:59.380
Sure!

00:15:02.550 --> 00:15:05.100
Wow, they look tasty!

00:15:05.100 --> 00:15:06.840
Be careful, they're hot.

00:15:08.820 --> 00:15:11.090
U-Um, Kaoru-sama?

00:15:11.090 --> 00:15:11.680
Here!

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:12.750
Eh!

00:15:13.340 --> 00:15:14.350
Ah!

00:15:15.160 --> 00:15:16.390
Ooya-san{Miss Landlord}!

00:15:17.310 --> 00:15:19.170
Oh, there you are.

00:15:19.170 --> 00:15:22.930
Ooya-san{Miss Landlord}, Tae-chin spilled the tea again.

00:15:22.930 --> 00:15:23.600
Heh!

00:15:23.600 --> 00:15:25.840
Sorry, but can you come back now?

00:15:25.840 --> 00:15:27.320
Uh, sure. I understood.

00:15:29.480 --> 00:15:31.000
I am sorry, Kaoru-sama.

00:15:36.920 --> 00:15:39.330
We finally had some time alone...

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:45.390
Uh, I'm sorry.

00:15:45.390 --> 00:15:46.690
Watch where you're going.

00:15:46.690 --> 00:15:48.200
Geez.

00:15:48.200 --> 00:15:50.020
Hiro-kun, are you all right?

00:15:56.510 --> 00:15:58.790
Then I will go deliver this.

00:15:59.170 --> 00:16:02.770
The comedy club's room is
at the right end of the hall.

00:16:02.770 --> 00:16:03.900
Don't go to the wrong place.

00:16:04.530 --> 00:16:05.440
Sure.

00:16:10.420 --> 00:16:11.280
I'm back!

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:13.150
Oh, good work.

00:16:13.150 --> 00:16:14.690
You can take some time off now.

00:16:15.090 --> 00:16:16.270
Thanks.

00:16:16.270 --> 00:16:18.080
Then I'll walk around for a bit.

00:16:18.590 --> 00:16:19.670
Onii-chan{Big Brother}!

00:16:19.670 --> 00:16:21.090
Oh, Chika-chan.

00:16:21.090 --> 00:16:22.160
Want to come with me?

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:24.420
I won't let that happen.

00:16:24.420 --> 00:16:29.250
Since, Hanabishi-sama with Mayu will be
making the conclusion of the autumn story!

00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:30.770
What are you talking about?

00:16:30.770 --> 00:16:32.760
It's not time for your break yet.

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:34.300
What are you doing?

00:16:33.540 --> 00:16:34.300
Come on!

00:16:34.300 --> 00:16:38.140
Let go! I said let go! Geez!

00:16:34.300 --> 00:16:36.210
You have dishes to wash!

00:16:40.150 --> 00:16:42.100
Onii-chan{Big Brother}, this way, this way!

00:16:42.100 --> 00:16:43.140
Don't tug so hard.

00:16:43.140 --> 00:16:46.140
I'm starving already! I want to eat...

00:16:43.140 --> 00:16:44.790
Kaoru-sama!

00:16:47.090 --> 00:16:48.280
Kaoru-sama.

00:16:53.640 --> 00:16:54.450
Ah!

00:16:57.300 --> 00:16:58.250
Kaoru-sam-

00:17:03.940 --> 00:17:05.650
Are you all right?

00:17:32.130 --> 00:17:33.190
Kaoru-sama-

00:17:36.150 --> 00:17:38.240
Excuse me, young lady!

00:17:38.240 --> 00:17:41.450
We are the Meiritsu Festival
Management Committee.

00:17:41.450 --> 00:17:43.330
Y-Yes?

00:17:43.840 --> 00:17:47.460
If you don't mind, we'd love for
you to enter this contest.

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:49.210
Please!

00:17:49.590 --> 00:17:51.730
Um, but...

00:17:51.730 --> 00:17:52.930
I would be troubled.

00:17:57.300 --> 00:17:58.840
Please!

00:17:59.390 --> 00:18:01.640
Please!

00:18:15.030 --> 00:18:17.590
That was really fun, Onii-chan{Big Brother}.

00:18:17.590 --> 00:18:19.160
Well, be careful now.

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:19.620
Yeah.

00:18:19.620 --> 00:18:22.110
I'll come by to play again.

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:25.540
Come anytime. We'll all be waiting.

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:26.570
See you!

00:18:37.090 --> 00:18:37.960
I'm back!

00:18:38.630 --> 00:18:40.890
Thank you for the hard work, Kaoru-sama.

00:18:41.530 --> 00:18:43.150
Thanks for the hard work, Aoi-chan.

00:18:43.600 --> 00:18:45.150
Oh, where is everyone?

00:18:45.150 --> 00:18:48.040
They went to return the borrowed materials.

00:18:48.040 --> 00:18:49.230
I see.

00:18:49.680 --> 00:18:51.220
How about some tea?

00:18:51.610 --> 00:18:53.190
Yeah, thanks.

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:58.150
Your tea really is delicious, Aoi-chan.

00:18:58.150 --> 00:18:59.490
Thank you very much.

00:19:00.110 --> 00:19:03.570
Um, I bought this earlier.

00:19:04.420 --> 00:19:08.470
I really wanted to eat takoyaki with you, Kaoru-sama.

00:19:08.470 --> 00:19:10.580
It has already gone cold, though.

00:19:10.870 --> 00:19:12.170
Sure.

00:19:12.540 --> 00:19:14.120
Here, Kaoru-sama.

00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:18.430
Yeah, it's delicious.

00:19:19.510 --> 00:19:20.840
I am glad.

00:19:27.780 --> 00:19:29.480
It's delicious.

00:19:36.690 --> 00:19:39.700
We finally have some time to ourselves.

00:19:39.700 --> 00:19:40.770
Yeah.

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:44.190
It really was fun today.

00:19:44.660 --> 00:19:49.880
Being so busy my head spun as well as
interacting with many people were new to me.

00:19:49.880 --> 00:19:50.660
But...

00:19:51.940 --> 00:19:56.090
Because you weren't near me, I was a little lonely.

00:19:56.090 --> 00:19:57.780
Aoi-chan.

00:19:57.780 --> 00:20:02.340
Seeing so many couples
come to play today, I thought.

00:20:02.340 --> 00:20:06.560
If only we could walk together like
that and we could enjoy ourselves...

00:20:08.930 --> 00:20:13.190
Kaoru-sama, you felt the same way that I did.

00:20:14.100 --> 00:20:15.520
I'm so glad.

00:20:22.940 --> 00:20:24.730
Um, Kaoru-sama?

00:20:25.180 --> 00:20:26.060
Eh?

00:20:26.310 --> 00:20:29.990
Can you stay still for just a moment?

00:20:30.380 --> 00:20:31.370
Sure.

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:42.880
S-Sorry!

00:20:55.330 --> 00:20:56.770
Thanks for the hard work!

00:21:00.230 --> 00:21:01.630
Kaoru,

00:21:01.630 --> 00:21:02.940
Ooya-san{Miss Landlord},

00:21:02.940 --> 00:21:04.070
What's wrong?

00:21:04.490 --> 00:21:06.460
N-Nothing.

00:21:06.460 --> 00:21:07.620
Nothing at all.

00:22:50.360 --> 00:22:51.390
We've got a huge problem!

00:22:52.520 --> 00:22:54.430
What's wrong, Tina-kichi?

00:22:54.430 --> 00:22:55.560
Ooya-san{Miss Landlord} has...

00:22:55.680 --> 00:22:57.350
Ooya-san{Miss Landlord} has...

00:22:57.350 --> 00:22:58.070
Eh?

00:22:58.730 --> 00:23:01.320
Ai Yori Aoshi, Influenza.

00:23:01.320 --> 00:23:03.940
Ooya-san{Miss Landlord} has...

00:23:03.940 --> 00:23:05.030
Huh, me?
